{{Unobtainable}}
'''Souma Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 428
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Souma Cat
|name2 = Stylish Souma Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Stylish Souma Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Souma Cat is similar to [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], but with much worse overall stats and shorter range. In exchange for the wave niche, Souma Cat's cooldown is half of Manic Macho Legs, which results in higher, more spammable DPS. However, unlike Manic Macho Legs, Souma is usable in 4-crown [[Stories of Legend]] stages, meaning that he can be used there as a replacement.

Do note that Souma Cat has a longer attack animation, meaning that he may not be able to produce waves if there are other attackers on the field.

{{Job|Classification = Waver}}

